    },
    {
      "id": "4EK1g1etZsq6nm-YCPus0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 485.19601879345873,
      "y": 10617.343301103563,
      "width": 781,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bfL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 265945327,
      "version": 100,
      "versionNonce": 1765625967,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1766911670121,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "i)SecurityFilterAutoConfiguration:\n\nAutomatically registers the DelegatingFilterProxy filter under the name\nspringSecurityFilterChain.\n\nii)DelegatingFilterProxy:\n\nThis filter intercepts incoming HTTP requests and delegates their\nprocessing to the FilterChainProxy.\n\niii)FilterChainProxy:\n\nThe FilterChainProxy bean manages a list of security filters defined in\nthe SecurityFilterChain. It determines which filters should be applied\nto the current request.\n\nv)SecurityFilterChain:\n\nThis component contains the filters that will be executed in sequence\nfor the request, handling various security aspects like authentication,\nauthorization, etc.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "i)SecurityFilterAutoConfiguration:\n\nAutomatically registers the DelegatingFilterProxy filter under the name springSecurityFilterChain.\n\nii)DelegatingFilterProxy:\n\nThis filter intercepts incoming HTTP requests and delegates their processing to the FilterChainProxy.\n\niii)FilterChainProxy:\n\nThe FilterChainProxy bean manages a list of security filters defined in the SecurityFilterChain. It determines which filters should be applied to the current request.\n\nv)SecurityFilterChain:\n\nThis component contains the filters that will be executed in sequence for the request, handling various security aspects like authentication, authorization, etc.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
