    {
      "id": "IdPRTPmtmrG5v5CT7fRSi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 503.4458285537528,
      "y": 18522.611196002763,
      "width": 1089,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bfg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1438935407,
      "version": 295,
      "versionNonce": 233869103,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1766916957856,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now a spring filter is just a middleware just like in nodejs and python and we need to understand \nspring filter a little bit more before we actually dive deep into how authentication follow really \nworks.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now a spring filter is just a middleware just like in nodejs and python and we need to understand \nspring filter a little bit more before we actually dive deep into how authentication follow really \nworks.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jXbBFBEZCOa6C4_WGRe6Z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 504.875759552014,
      "y": 18694.01569337951,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bfh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 726557441,
      "version": 73,
      "versionNonce": 1749420271,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1766917130348,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What's a middleware?\n\nAnswer:middleware is a gatekeeper that sits in front of your controller.\n\nIt can:\n\na)Look at the incoming HTTP request\n\nb)Modify it\n\nc)Reject it\n\nPass it forward\n\n👉 Controller never sees the request until middleware finish",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What's a middleware?\n\nAnswer:middleware is a gatekeeper that sits in front of your controller.\n\nIt can:\n\na)Look at the incoming HTTP request\n\nb)Modify it\n\nc)Reject it\n\nPass it forward\n\n👉 Controller never sees the request until middleware finish",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8bV_Ya0qPfovnC-GRhDn4",
