      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1766917387864,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🧱 Where Filters Come From (Java Side)\n\nFilters are NOT Spring-specific originally.\n\nThey come from Servlet API:\n\njakarta.servlet.Filter\n\n\nA filter has 3 methods:\n\npublic interface Filter {\n    void init(FilterConfig config);\n    void doFilter(\n        ServletRequest request,\n        ServletResponse response,\n        FilterChain chain\n    );\n    void destroy();\n}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🧱 Where Filters Come From (Java Side)\n\nFilters are NOT Spring-specific originally.\n\nThey come from Servlet API:\n\njakarta.servlet.Filter\n\n\nA filter has 3 methods:\n\npublic interface Filter {\n    void init(FilterConfig config);\n    void doFilter(\n        ServletRequest request,\n        ServletResponse response,\n        FilterChain chain\n    );\n    void destroy();\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
