      "seed": 644610255,
      "version": 65,
      "versionNonce": 303069089,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1766917763844,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔐 Spring Security Filters (Special Filters)\n\nSpring Security is basically a CHAIN OF FILTERS.\n\nWhen you add:\n\nspring-boot-starter-security\n\n\nSpring auto-registers ~15–20 filters.\n\n🧵 Security Filter Chain\nSecurityFilterChain\n ├── UsernamePasswordAuthenticationFilter\n ├── JwtAuthenticationFilter (custom)\n ├── BasicAuthenticationFilter\n ├── ExceptionTranslationFilter\n ├── AuthorizationFilter\n\n\nEach filter has one responsibility.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔐 Spring Security Filters (Special Filters)\n\nSpring Security is basically a CHAIN OF FILTERS.\n\nWhen you add:\n\nspring-boot-starter-security\n\n\nSpring auto-registers ~15–20 filters.\n\n🧵 Security Filter Chain\nSecurityFilterChain\n ├── UsernamePasswordAuthenticationFilter\n ├── JwtAuthenticationFilter (custom)\n ├── BasicAuthenticationFilter\n ├── ExceptionTranslationFilter\n ├── AuthorizationFilter\n\n\nEach filter has one responsibility.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
