      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🧩 Where Authentication Comes From?\n\nFrom Security Filters, NOT controller.\n\nExample:\n\npublic Todo createTodo(Authentication auth) {\n    auth.getName(); // username\n}\n\n\n➡️ Spring injects it from SecurityContext",
      "fontSize": 22.144785771379482,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🧩 Where Authentication Comes From?\n\nFrom Security Filters, NOT controller.\n\nExample:\n\npublic Todo createTodo(Authentication auth) {\n    auth.getName(); // username\n}\n\n\n➡️ Spring injects it from SecurityContext",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
