      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3️⃣ What is UserDetails Exactly?\npublic interface UserDetails {\n    String getUsername();\n    String getPassword();\n    Collection<? extends GrantedAuthority> getAuthorities();\n    boolean isAccountNonExpired();\n    boolean isAccountNonLocked();\n    boolean isCredentialsNonExpired();\n    boolean isEnabled();\n}\n\n\n📌 This is a security contract.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3️⃣ What is UserDetails Exactly?\npublic interface UserDetails {\n    String getUsername();\n    String getPassword();\n    Collection<? extends GrantedAuthority> getAuthorities();\n    boolean isAccountNonExpired();\n    boolean isAccountNonLocked();\n    boolean isCredentialsNonExpired();\n    boolean isEnabled();\n}\n\n\n📌 This is a security contract.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
