      "versionNonce": 2034146849,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1766923015491,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5️⃣ What About org.springframework.security.core.userdetails.User?\n\nSpring Security also gives a ready-made User class:\n\nUser user = User\n    .withUsername(\"admin\")\n    .password(\"password\")\n    .roles(\"ADMIN\")\n    .build();\n\nUse this when:\n\nNo database\n\nIn-memory users\n\nQuick demo / testing\n\n❌ Do NOT use for real applications",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5️⃣ What About org.springframework.security.core.userdetails.User?\n\nSpring Security also gives a ready-made User class:\n\nUser user = User\n    .withUsername(\"admin\")\n    .password(\"password\")\n    .roles(\"ADMIN\")\n    .build();\n\nUse this when:\n\nNo database\n\nIn-memory users\n\nQuick demo / testing\n\n❌ Do NOT use for real applications",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
