      "seed": 1502776449,
      "version": 112,
      "versionNonce": 312788495,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1766923069722,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6️⃣ UserDetailsService — Who Creates UserDetails?\n\nSpring Security calls this automatically.\n\npublic interface UserDetailsService {\n    UserDetails loadUserByUsername(String username);\n}\n\n\nYour implementation:\n\n@Service\npublic class CustomUserDetailsService implements UserDetailsService {\n\n    private final UserRepository repo;\n\n    @Override\n    public UserDetails loadUserByUsername(String username) {\n        UserEntity user = repo.findByEmail(username)\n            .orElseThrow();\n\n        return new CustomUserDetails(user);\n    }\n}\n\n\n📌 Spring Security never touches your DB directly.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6️⃣ UserDetailsService — Who Creates UserDetails?\n\nSpring Security calls this automatically.\n\npublic interface UserDetailsService {\n    UserDetails loadUserByUsername(String username);\n}\n\n\nYour implementation:\n\n@Service\npublic class CustomUserDetailsService implements UserDetailsService {\n\n    private final UserRepository repo;\n\n    @Override\n    public UserDetails loadUserByUsername(String username) {\n        UserEntity user = repo.findByEmail(username)\n            .orElseThrow();\n\n        return new CustomUserDetails(user);\n    }\n}\n\n\n📌 Spring Security never touches your DB directly.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
